==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[parking]] [[lot]]}}

# {{context|North America}} An open area, generally paved, where automobiles may be left when not in use.
#: ''Should we park in that '''parking lot''', or in the garage up the street?''
#* '''1970''', Joni Mitchell, "Big Yellow Taxi" (song)
#*: They paved paradise and put up a '''parking lot'''.
# {{US}} {{idiomatic}} A major [[thruway]] blocked by [[stop and go traffic]].
#: ''The 101 was a '''parking lot''' again today.

